َّىٰ","english":"celebrates the Name of his Lord, and prays.","transliteration_html":"Wa<u>th</u>akara isma rabbihi fa<u>s</u>all<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Wathakara isma rabbihi fasalla"},{"sura":87,"aya":16,"key":"87:16","arabic":"بَلْ تُؤْثِرُونَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا","english":"But you prefer the life of this world,","transliteration_html":"Bal tuthiroona al<u>h</u>ay<u>a</u>ta a<b>l</b>dduny<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Bal tuthiroona alhayata alddunya"},{"sura":87,"aya":17,"key":"87:17","arabic":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةُ خَيْرٌۭ وَأَبْقَىٰٓ","english":"while the Hereafter is better and more lasting.’","transliteration_html":"Wa<b>a</b>l<u>a</u>khiratu khayrun waabq<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Waalakhiratu khayrun waabqa"},{"sura":87,"aya":18,"key":"87:18","arabic":"إِنَّ هَـٰذَا لَفِى ٱلصُّحُفِ ٱلْأُولَىٰ","english":"This is indeed in the former scriptures,","transliteration_html":"Inna h<u>atha</u> lafee a<b>l</b><u>ss</u>u<u>h</u>ufi alool<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Inna hatha lafee alssuhufi aloola"},{"sura":87,"aya":19,"key":"87:19","arabic":"صُحُفِ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَمُوسَىٰ","english":"the scriptures of Abraham and Moses.","transliteration_html":"<u>S</u>u<u>h</u>ufi ibr<u>a</u>heema wamoos<u>a</u>","transliteration_text":"Suhufi ibraheema wamoosa"}]}